  "description": "Default scenario: two parallel one-way arterials into Hatfield, Pretoria, each with 4 signalised intersections, linked by 4 signalised two-way cross-streets 245 m apart. Demand oscillates sinusoidally between a min and max over a 300 s period rather than holding constant (equations.js's fluctuatingDemand()) - fixed-time/green-wave time their Webster plan once to the range's midpoint (a stand-in for a historical traffic count) and never re-tune as the live rate wanders away from it, while adaptive/actuated modes keep sensing the live queue as usual.",
